## Usage

```svelte
<script>
	import { CalendarDatePicker } from 'fluentui-svelte';

	let value = $state(null);
</script>

<CalendarDatePicker bind:value />
```

## Component API

The `CalendarDatePicker` combines a button trigger with a `CalendarView` popup. Clicking the trigger opens the calendar, and selecting a day updates the bound `value` and closes the popup. Because it builds on `CalendarView`, calendar props such as `blackoutDates`, `minDate`, `maxDate`, `weekStart` and `headers` are forwarded straight to the popup calendar. You can see the full list in the [Component Props](#component-props) table below.
